[{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0064","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0211","title":"Xinetd 拒绝连接内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"xinetd 2.1.x 至 2.3.10 版本存在内存泄漏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过大量发送被拒绝的连接请求，导致 xinetd 服务消耗大量系统内存，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 xinetd 在处理被拒绝连接时未能正确释放已分配的内存资源，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至 xinetd 2.3.11 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0211"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:45Z","remediation":"升级 xinetd 至 2.3.11 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:078 提供的更新包；Debian 用户应用 DSA-299 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在 xinetd 配置中限制每个服务的最大连接实例数（如 `instances = 10`）并启用 `per_source` 参数限制单 IP 并发连接数，以降低内存泄漏风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=88537","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000782","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105068673220605&w=2","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:056","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-160.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A657","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22508","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0211.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0211","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0211.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0211.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2003/CVE-2003-0211.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0211.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0211.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0211.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0211.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-02xx/CVE-2003-0211.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0063","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0204","title":"KDE kghostview 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"KDE 桌面环境的 kghostview 程序在调用 Ghostscript 处理 PostScript（PS）和 PDF 文件时，未传递 -dPARANOIDSAFER 和 -dSAFER 安全参数，导致沙箱逃逸防护失效。远程攻击者可诱骗用户打开特制的 PS 或 PDF 文件，在目标系统上执行任意命令，完全控制受影响主机。该漏洞影响 KDE 2 及 KDE 3.1.1 及更早的 3.x 版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用难度较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0204"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:44Z","remediation":"立即升级 KDE 至 3.0.5b 或 3.1.1a 及以上版本，下载地址 https://download.kde.org/stable/。如无法升级，可手动应用补丁：从 ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/security_patches/ 下载对应版本的 post-3.1.1-kdebase-thumbnail.diff、post-3.1.1-kdegraphics-kdvi.diff、post-3.1.1-kdegraphics-kghostview.diff 和 post-3.1.1-kdelibs-kimgio.diff 并依次打补丁。临时缓解措施：删除 kghostview.desktop、thumbnail.protocol、eps.kimgio 和 kdvi.desktop 文件后重启 KDE，禁用文件预览和 PS/PDF 处理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=53343","http://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=56808","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000668","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000747","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105001557020141&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105012994719099&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105017403010459&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105034222521369&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-284","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-293","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-296","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20030409-1.txt","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:049","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-002.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0204.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0204","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0204.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2003/CVE-2003-0204.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0204.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0204.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0204.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0204.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0204.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-02xx/CVE-2003-0204.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0044","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0136","title":"LPRng psbanner 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"LPRng 打印系统中的 psbanner 工具存在不安全临时文件处理漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp/before 临时文件上创建符号链接，利用 psbanner 以提升的权限写入任意文件，导致本地权限提升或敏感文件被覆盖。攻击条件为拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用。该漏洞影响 LPRng 各版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0136"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:37Z","remediation":"升级 LPRng 至 3.8.28 或更高版本。Debian 用户安装 DSA-285 对应更新包（apt-get update && apt-get upgrade lprng）；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:142 对应更新。临时缓解措施：删除 psbanner 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/psbanner），或限制本地用户对 /tmp/before 文件的写权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?archive=no&bug=188366","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-285","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-142.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A423","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0136.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0136","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0136.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0136.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0136.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2003/CVE-2003-0136.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0136.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0136.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0136.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0136.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0042","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0133","title":"GNOME GtkHTML 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Evolution 邮件客户端内置的 GtkHTML 组件在处理特制畸形邮件消息时存在解析缺陷，远程攻击者可向目标用户发送包含恶意构造内容的邮件，触发 GtkHTML 解析器内存访问异常，导致 Evolution 客户端崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Evolution 1.2.4 之前版本，攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户预览或打开恶意邮件即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0133"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:36Z","remediation":"升级 GNOME Evolution 至 1.2.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 GtkHTML 组件解析畸形邮件导致崩溃的问题。如无法升级，建议禁用 Evolution 的 HTML 邮件预览功能，仅以纯文本方式查看邮件，或改用其他邮件客户端作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000737","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:046","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-126.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A138","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0133.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0133.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0133","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0133.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0133.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/afea9e4d3a1176ab218afc5d6d560a6f135838c1/2003/CVE-2003-0133.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0133.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0133.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0133.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0133.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0042.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0043","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0135","title":"Red Hat Linux 9 vsftpd TCP Wrappers 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 9 系统中 vsftpd FTP 服务在编译时未集成 TCP Wrappers（tcp_wrappers）支持，且以独立服务模式运行，导致系统管理员通过 hosts.allow 和 hosts.deny 配置的访问控制规则无法生效。远程攻击者可利用此缺陷绕过预期的 IP 地址访问限制，未经授权访问目标系统的 FTP 服务，进而可能进行文件读取、上传或进一步渗透。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 9 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0135"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:37Z","remediation":"升级 vsftpd 至 1.1.3 或更高版本（该版本已启用 TCP wrappers 编译支持），或重新编译当前 vsftpd 时加入 `--with-tcp-wrappers` 选项。如无法升级，使用 iptables 防火墙规则限制 FTP 服务（默认端口 21）的源 IP 范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-084.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7253","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A634","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0135.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0135.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0135","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0135.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0135.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0135.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2003/CVE-2003-0135.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0135.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0135.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0135.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0041","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0132","title":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0.44 及之前版本换行符内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0 至 2.0.44 版本存在内存泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送大量换行符（linefeed）触发该漏洞，Apache 会为每个换行符分配 80 字节内存而未能正确释放，导致服务器内存被持续消耗，最终造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可发起，影响范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0132"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:36Z","remediation":"[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2003-00001\"\nname = \"CVE-2003-0132 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"medium\"\ntags = [\"cve-2003-0132\", \"apache\", \"dos\", \"memory-leak\"]\ndescription = \"Apache HTTP Server 2.0.44及之前版本存在内存泄漏漏洞，通过发送大量换行符触发，每个换行符分配80字节内存\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2003-0132\", \"AVE-2003-00001\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/\"\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"status\"\nstatus = [200]\nexpect = true\n```\n\nHmm, but the PoC needs to actually trigger the vulnerability. The vulnerability is triggered by sending many linefeed characters. Let me think about how to do this in the PoC format.\n\nActually, for a memory leak DoS, the PoC would need to send many linefeed characters. In the HTTP protocol, this could be done by sending a request with many linefeed characters in the body or headers.\n\nLet me create a more appropriate PoC. Since this is a memory leak triggered by linefeed characters, the PoC should send a large number of linefeed characters.\n\nFor the PoC, I'll use a raw TCP approach since we need to send raw linefeed characters:\n\n```toml\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"tcp\"\npath = \"{{Hostname}}:{{Port}}\"\n\n[poc.requests.raw]\ntype = \"tcp\"\ncontent = \"GET / HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: {{Hostname}}\\r\\nConnection: close\\r\\nContent-Length: 10000\\r\\n\\r\\n\" + many linefeeds\n```\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The vulnerability is about linefeed characters (0x0A). In HTTP, linefeed characters are used as line terminators. The vulnerability is that Apache allocates 80 bytes for each linefeed character it receives. So sending many linefeed characters would cause memory exhaustion.\n\nA simple PoC would be to send a request with many linefeed characters. Let me use the TCP protocol for this since we need to send raw bytes.\n\nActually, I think the simplest approach is to use the HTTP protocol with a body containing many linefeed characters, or use TCP raw.\n\nLet me go with TCP raw since it gives us more control over the exact bytes sent.\n\nFor the EXP, since this is a DoS vulnerability (memory leak), there's no real \"exploit\" beyond the DoS itself. The PoC is essentially the same as the EXP for a DoS. I'll output NO_EXP since there's no code execution or data exfiltration possible.\n\nWait, actually the skill says \"PoC = 安全无损验证；EXP = 完整利用，仅当网上有明确利用方法时生成\". For a memory leak DoS, the PoC is the same as the \"exploit\" since the only impact is DoS. Let me just provide the PoC and NO_EXP.\n\nLet me now write the complete output.\n\nFor the remediation field, I need to write in Chinese, ≥20 characters. The fix was in Apache 2.0.45. Since Apache 2.0 is EOL, the recommendation should be to upgrade to a supported version.\n\nLet me construct the full TOML now.\n\nActually, I realize I should also check if there's an existing AVE ID. Let me look at the meta.db or existing files. But I don't have access to that. I'll assume this is a new entry.\n\nLet me also think about the AVE ID format. The skill says `AVE-YYYY-NNNNN`. For 2003, I'll use AVE-2003-00001.\n\nNow let me write the complete TOML output.\n\nFor the PoC, I need to think about what exactly triggers the vulnerability. The vulnerability is triggered by sending large chunks of linefeed characters. In HTTP, linefeed characters (0x0A, \\n) are used as line terminators. The issue is that Apache allocates 80 bytes for each linefeed character it receives.\n\nA PoC would send many linefeed characters to the Apache server. This could be done by:\n1. Sending a request with many linefeed characters in the body\n2. Sending many linefeed characters as raw data\n\nLet me create a TCP-based PoC that sends many linefeed characters.\n\nActually, I think the simplest and most accurate PoC would be to use the HTTP protocol and send a request with many linefeed characters. But the HTTP protocol in the PoC schema doesn't easily support sending raw linefeed characters in the body.\n\nLet me use the TCP protocol instead, which allows raw byte sending.\n\nFor the PoC:\n```toml\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"tcp\"\npath = \"{{Hostname}}:{{Port}}\"\n\n[poc.requests.raw]\ntype = \"tcp\"\ncontent = \"GET / HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: {{Hostname}}\\r\\n\\r\\nAAAAAAAAAA...\"  # many linefeeds\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/mhonarc/security-announce/msg00028.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104931360606484&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104982175321731&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104994239010517&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104994309010974&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105001663120995&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105013378320711&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/34920","http://secunia.com/advisories/8499","http://support.ca.com/irj/portal/anonymous/phpsupcontent?contentID=205147","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/04.08.03.txt","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/206537","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-139.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2009/1233","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5df9bfb86a3b054bb985a45ff9250b0332c9ecc181eec232489e7f79%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0276683d8e1e07153fc8642618830ac0ade85b9ae0dc7b07f63bb8fc%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r2cb985de917e7da0848c440535f65a247754db8b2154a10089e4247b%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5001ecf3d6b2bdd0b732e527654248abb264f08390045d30709a92f6%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r7035b7c9091c4b665a3b7205364775410646f12125d48e74e395f2ce%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r8828e649175df56f1f9e3919938ac7826128525426e2748f0ab62feb%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9e8622254184645bc963a1d47c5d47f6d5a36d6f080d8d2c43b2b142%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rd00b45b93fda4a5bd013b28587207d0e00f99f6e3308dbb6025f3b01%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/re028d61fe612b0908595d658b9b39e74bca56f2a1ed3c5f06b5ab571%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A156","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/9","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2003/CVE-2003-0132.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0132.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0132.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2003/CVE-2003-0132.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0132","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/d5067406bc0902f8174cb5f8d595f637951974ce/program/databases/db_server_msgs","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2003/CVE-2003-0132.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0132.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/db09292fb11e6e85f066b9d4f61163327f785736/CVEs/2003/CVE-2003-0132.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2003/CVE-2003-0132.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0055","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0161","title":"Sendmail prescan() 地址解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.12.9 之前版本中的地址解析器（parseaddr.c）的 prescan() 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数在处理 char 和 int 类型转换时存在缺陷，当 Sendmail 将特定输入值错误解释为特殊的 \"NOCHAR\" 控制值时，会导致长度检查被禁用，从而触发缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过向目标邮件服务器发送特制的邮件消息触发此漏洞，导致服务拒绝，在特定条件下可执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Sendmail 8.12.9 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0161"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:40Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.12.9 或更高版本，该版本修复了 prescan() 函数中 char/int 类型转换处理不当导致的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在邮件服务器上部署入侵检测规则监控异常邮件流量，并限制 SMTP 连接来源以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000614","http://lists.apple.com/mhonarc/security-announce/msg00028.html","http://lists.grok.org.uk/pipermail/full-disclosure/2003-March/004295.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104896621106790&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104897487512238&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104914999806315&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-52620-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-52700-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-77-1001088.1-1","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2003-12.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-278","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-290","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-200303-27.xml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/897604","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-120.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-121.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316961/30/25250/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/317135/30/25220/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/321997","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7230","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22442"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0054","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0165","title":"GNOME Eye Of Gnome 格式字符串漏洞","description":"GNOME Eye Of Gnome（EOG）图像查看器存在格式字符串漏洞，由于程序在处理命令行参数中的文件名时未对格式字符串说明符进行安全过滤，本地攻击者可通过向 eog 命令传递特制的包含 %n、%s 等格式说明符的文件名参数触发该漏洞，导致以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Eye Of Gnome 1.0.x、1.1.x 及 2.2 版本，攻击者需具有本地访问权限才能利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0165"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:40Z","remediation":"升级 Eye of GNOME (EOG) 至修复版本：Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2003-128 提供的更新包；Debian 用户应用 DSA-271 安全更新；Mandriva 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:048 更新。如无法升级，避免通过命令行参数直接传递不可信文件名给 eog 命令，改用文件选择器打开文件，并确保不以 root 权限运行 EOG 以限制利用影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0157.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104887189724146&w=2","http://www.coresecurity.com/common/showdoc.php?idx=312&idxseccion=10","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/363001","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:048","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-128.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7121","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A52","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22376","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0165.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0165","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0165.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0165.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4b74475b4552ac50c2b0e9c897e19d52aaa35c66/2003/CVE-2003-0165.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0165.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0165.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0165.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0165.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0165.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0053","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0160","title":"SquirrelMail SquirrelMail 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"SquirrelMail 1.2.11 之前版本存在多处跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于对用户输入的数据过滤不足，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 URL 或电子邮件内容注入任意 HTML 代码和 JavaScript 脚本。当受害用户访问包含恶意载荷的页面时，脚本会在其浏览器上下文中执行，导致会话劫持、敏感信息窃取（如 Cookie、凭据）、钓鱼攻击或恶意操作执行。该漏洞影响所有未升级至 1.2.11 版本的 SquirrelMail Webmail 部署，CVSS 评分 5.8（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度中等、无需身份认证，主要影响机密性和完整性。官方已在 1.2.11 版本中修复此问题，用户应尽快升级。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0160"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:40Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.11 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置输入过滤规则拦截包含脚本标签的恶意请求，或暂时禁用易受攻击的邮件阅读功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sourceforge.net/mailarchive/forum.php?thread_id=1641953&forum_id=1988","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-112.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A614","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0160.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0160","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0160.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0160.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0160.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0160.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/20ec019115a0b1de7bc97fc35bb5f73fa34a0aae/2003/CVE-2003-0160.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0160.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0160.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0160.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0052","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0159","title":"Ethereal NTLMSSP 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ethereal（现 Wireshark）0.9.9 及更早版本的 NTLMSSP 协议解析代码中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的网络数据包触发该漏洞，导致 Ethereal 服务崩溃（拒绝服务），甚至可能利用该漏洞在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Ethereal 0.9.9 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。用户需升级至更新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0159"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:40Z","remediation":"升级 Ethereal 至 0.9.10 或更高版本。Ethereal 已更名为 Wireshark，建议直接安装最新版 Wireshark（当前最新稳定版）。如无法升级，可在防火墙规则中限制 NTLMSSP 协议流量仅允许可信来源访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104741640924709&w=2","http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00008.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:051","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_019_ethereal.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-077.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7050","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A55","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0159.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0159","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0159.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0159.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/20ec019115a0b1de7bc97fc35bb5f73fa34a0aae/2003/CVE-2003-0159.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0159.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0159.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0159.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0159.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0159.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0027","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0083","title":"Apache HTTP Server 日志终端转义序列注入漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.25之前版本及2.0.46之前版本的访问日志未对终端转义序列进行过滤处理，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送包含恶意转义序列的HTTP请求，当管理员使用存在转义序列相关漏洞的终端模拟器查看日志时，这些序列会被终端模拟器解析执行，可能导致终端命令注入或信息泄露。该漏洞利用需要管理员主动查看日志文件，属于间接攻击方式，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0083"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:29Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.26 及以上版本（1.3 分支）或 2.0.46 及以上版本（2.0 分支）。如无法立即升级，可在访问日志处理管道中添加日志清洗工具（如 cat -v 或 sed 过滤转义序列），避免使用存在终端转义序列漏洞的终端模拟器查看日志。同时限制日志文件的访问权限，防止攻击者写入恶意日志条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cvs.apache.org/viewcvs.cgi/apache-1.3/src/modules/standard/mod_log_