本。攻击者在获取同一 Kerberos 域内任意有效凭据完成身份认证后，可向 KDC 发送特制协议请求，触发堆缓冲区下溢（buffer underrun），导致 KDC 进程崩溃而拒绝服务，进而影响整个域内用户的身份认证服务。该漏洞利用网络可达性进行攻击，攻击复杂度低，无需额外权限即可造成服务中断。Red Hat 已将该漏洞评级为重要级别，CVSS 评分为 5.0，建议升级至 1.3 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0082"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:29Z","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 1.3 及以上版本，或应用 MIT 官方补丁（http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/MITKRB5-SA-2003-005-patch.txt）。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003-051/052/091 提供的更新包；Debian 用户安装 DSA-266 提供的 krb5 更新包。如无法立即升级，在 KDC 上限制仅受信任主机可访问 Kerberos 服务端口 88 作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-54042-1","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/MITKRB5-SA-2003-005-buf.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-266","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-051.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-052.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-091.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316960/30/25250/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7185","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A244","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2536","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A4430","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0082.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2003/CVE-2003-0082.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0082","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0082.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2003/CVE-2003-0082.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a5f32c7015b5096d8cfd855ae981350d42219587/2003/CVE-2003-0082.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0082.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0082.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0082.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0082.json","https://github.com/anilkashyap01/Binary-Exploitation-and-Kernel-Escalation"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0019","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0072","title":"MIT Kerberos 5 KDC 数组越界读取拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos 5（krb5）1.2.7 及更早版本的密钥分发中心（KDC）存在数组越界读取漏洞（Array Overrun）。已通过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向同一域内的 KDC 发送特制的协议请求触发该漏洞，导致 KDC 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Kerberos 5 1.2.7 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。Red Hat 将其标记为重要（Important）安全漏洞，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0072"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:27Z","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 1.2.8 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:051/RHSA-2003:052 提供的更新包；Debian 用户安装 DSA-266 提供的更新包；Solaris 用户安装 Sun 补丁 54042-1。如无法升级，可应用 MIT 官方补丁 MITKRB5-SA-2003-005-patch 修复 krb5 主体名处理中的数组越界问题，并在 KDC 上限制仅受信任的认证客户端可发起请求以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-54042-1","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/MITKRB5-SA-2003-005-buf.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-266","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-051.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-052.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316960/30/25250/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0072.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2003/CVE-2003-0072.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0072","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0072.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0072","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2003/CVE-2003-0072.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0072","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0072","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0072.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/106a1fdac91d72807fea971dfa93d601744b9ae9/2003/CVE-2003-0072.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0050","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0147","title":"OpenSSL RSA Timing侧信道攻击信息泄露漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 默认未启用 RSA 盲化机制，存在计时侧信道攻击漏洞。本地或远程攻击者可通过精确测量 Montgomery 约减中额外规约操作的次数差异，以及 Karatsuba 与普通整数乘法算法之间的执行时间差异，推断出服务器的 RSA 私钥信息。该漏洞影响 OpenSSL 0.9.7 及之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程发起计时攻击，导致私钥泄露，危害严重。建议升级至 OpenSSL 0.9.7b 或更高版本并启用 RSA 盲化。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0147"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.7b 或 0.9.6j 及以上版本，该版本默认启用 RSA Blinding 机制以防御计时攻击。如无法升级，可在编译时添加 -DOPENSSL_NO_FORCE_RSA_BLINDING 禁用强制盲化，或手动调用 RSA_blinding_on() 开启盲化。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Debian 安装 DSA-288 补丁、Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2003:101/102、Gentoo 安装 GLSA-200303-23。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0130.html","http://crypto.stanford.edu/~dabo/papers/ssl-timing.pdf","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000625","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104766550528628&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104792570615648&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104819602408063&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104829040921835&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104861762028637&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-288","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-200303-23.xml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/997481","http://www.mandrakesecure.net/en/advisories/advisory.php?name=MDKSA-2003:035","http://www.openpkg.com/security/advisories/OpenPKG-SA-2003.019.html","http://www.openssl.org/news/secadv_20030317.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-101.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-102.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316165/30/25370/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/316577/30/25310/threaded","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A466","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2003/CVE-2003-0147.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2003/CVE-2003-0147.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0147.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0147","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0147","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/db09292fb11e6e85f066b9d4f61163327f785736/CVEs/2003/CVE-2003-0147.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0147","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2003/CVE-2003-0147.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0147"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0049","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0146","title":"NetPBM 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NetPBM 9.20 及更早版本中存在多个整数溢出和整数符号错误漏洞，这些数学运算溢出缺陷可导致缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的图像文件触发该漏洞，成功利用后可导致拒绝服务或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 NetPBM 9.20 及之前所有版本，攻击无需身份认证且复杂度较低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0146"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:38Z","remediation":"升级 NetPBM 至 9.20-8 或更高版本（Debian 对应 DSA-263，Red Hat 对应 RHSA-2003:060）。如无法立即升级，可限制仅受信任用户调用 NetPBM 相关工具（如 pnmtojpeg、ppmtogif 等），并避免处理来自不可信来源的图像文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000656","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104644687816522&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-263","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/630433","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-060.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6979","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11463","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2